OL,5,G2305 The First Omen
OL,6,     F(2024) Ever wondered how Damian -
OL,7,     Faka son of Satan - from the
OL,8,     Fseminal 1976 horror The Omen came
OL,9,     Fto be spawned? Well, wonder no
OL,10,     Fmore - this dark prequel with Nell
OL,11,     FTiger Free tells the tale.
OL,12,G0125 The Black Phone
OL,13,     F(2021) Horror with Ethan Hawke.
